#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:6
msgid "# Unified Recall Retrieval and Loading Flow"
msgstr "# Recall 统一检索与加载流程"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:9
msgid ""
"> **v1 ✅ Implemented:** `memory_recall(query)` four-source unified recall + "
"RRF reranking, returns `results[]` (distinguished by `memory_type`); session "
"hits are snippets ([`life/memory/src/recall-search.ts`](../../life/memory/"
"src/recall-search.ts)).  > **v2 target design** (not implemented): resource "
"layer + preset + lean index loading chain, see [Issue #47](https://"
"github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/47)."
msgstr ""
"> **v1 ✅ 已实现**：`memory_recall(query)` 四源统一召回 + RRF 重排，返回 "
"`results[]`（`memory_type` 区分）；会话命中为 snippet（[`life/memory/src/"
"recall-search.ts`](../../life/memory/src/recall-search.ts)）。 > **v2 目标设"
"计**（未实现）：资源层 + preset + 瘦索引加载链，见 [Issue #47](https://"
"github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/47)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:11
msgid "## v1 Implemented"
msgstr "## v1 已实现"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Capability | Description |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------- |\n"
"| `memory_recall` | Four sources: semantic / session / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; session returns snippet |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | Session message FTS; returns snippet (not full content) |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | semantic_memory CRUD |\n"
"| Resident memory | system prompt injection (not recall) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力              | 说明                                                                           |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | semantic / session / limbic / autobiographical 四源；Top N；session 为 snippet |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | 会话消息 FTS；返回 snippet（非整条 content）                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | semantic_memory CRUD                                                           |\n"
"| 常驻记忆          | system prompt 注入（非 recall）                                                |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:20
msgid "## v2 Target Design (Issue #47)"
msgstr "## v2 目标设计（Issue #47）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:22
msgid "> The following is v2 design draft, **not current runtime behavior**."
msgstr "> 以下为 v2 设计稿，**非当前运行时行为**。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:26
msgid ""
"**`recall` retrieves only, does not load.** Returns lean index (title + "
"description + type + id), not full content."
msgstr ""
"**`recall` 只做检索，不做加载。** 返回精简的索引（标题+描述+类型+标识），不返"
"回完整内容。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:26
msgid ""
"**Scope: memory layer + resource layer.** Self layer always injected in "
"system prompt, outside recall scope."
msgstr ""
"**检索范围：记忆层 + 资源层。** 自我层始终注入系统提示词，不在 recall 范围"
"内。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:26
msgid ""
"**Loading handled by downstream tools.** recall tells the LLM \"what "
"exists\"; LLM decides \"what to fetch\", then calls corresponding load tools."
msgstr ""
"**加载由下游工具负责。** recall 告诉 LLM\"有什么\"，LLM 决定\"要什么\"，然后"
"调对应的加载工具。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:28
msgid "## Retrieval Scope (v2 Design)"
msgstr "## 检索范围（v2 设计）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"recall unified retrieval\n"
"├── Memory Layer\n"
"│   ├── Semantic memory — semantic_memory (world/experience/opinion/…)\n"
"│   ├── Episodic memory — messages (conversation FTS)\n"
"│   ├── Procedural memory — skills / procedural facts\n"
"│   └── Limbic memory — imprint (semantic_memory); limbic table (✅ implemented, light sleep Phase 2 writes, not via recall)\n"
"│\n"
"└── Resource Layer (Estate Layer, v2 design)\n"
"    ├── Tools\n"
"    ├── Skills\n"
"    ├── Internal assets (notes, projects, code, docs)\n"
"    └── Entity graph\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"recall 统一检索\n"
"├── 记忆层（Memory Layer）\n"
"│   ├── 语义记忆 — semantic_memory（world/experience/opinion/…）\n"
"│   ├── 情景记忆 — messages（对话 FTS）\n"
"│   ├── 程序记忆 — skills / procedural facts\n"
"│   └── 感性记忆 — imprint（semantic_memory）；limbic 表（✅ 已实现，浅睡 Phase 2 写入，不经 recall）\n"
"│\n"
"└── 资源层（Estate Layer，v2 设计）\n"
"    ├── 工具（Tools）\n"
"    ├── 技能（Skills）\n"
"    ├── 内部资产（笔记、项目、代码、文档）\n"
"    └── 实体关系（Entity Graph）\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:45
msgid "### Out of Retrieval Scope"
msgstr "### 不在检索范围内的"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Content | Reason | Access |\n"
"| ------- | ------ | ------ |\n"
"| Self layer six blocks | Small, always needed | Always injected in system prompt |\n"
"| Full tool schemas | Needed only before call | `load_tools` (v2) / existing `reload_tools` |\n"
"| Full memory detail | Needed on demand | `read_memory` (v2) / existing `remember` single-row read |\n"
"| Full file content | Needed on demand | `read_file` ✅ |\n"
"| Entity relationship network | Traverse on demand | `graph_query` (v2) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 内容            | 理由           | 获取方式                                    |\n"
"| --------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 自我层六块      | 量小，始终需要 | 始终注入 system prompt                      |\n"
"| 完整工具 Schema | 只在调用前需要 | `load_tools`（v2）/ 现有 `reload_tools`     |\n"
"| 完整记忆详情    | 只在需要时读取 | `read_memory`（v2）/ 现有 `remember` 读单条 |\n"
"| 文件完整内容    | 只在需要时读取 | `read_file` ✅                              |\n"
"| 实体关系网络    | 只在需要时遍历 | `graph_query`（v2）                         |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:55
msgid "## Presets (v2 Design)"
msgstr "## 预设（Preset）（v2 设计）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:57
msgid ""
"`recall` uses `preset` parameter to steer search direction. Presets are "
"**weighting templates** over memory/resource types."
msgstr ""
"`recall` 通过 `preset` 参数控制不同搜索方向。预设本质上是**对不同记忆/资源类"
"型的结果加权模板**。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:59
msgid "### Preset Definitions"
msgstr "### 预设定义"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Preset | Semantic | Episodic | Limbic | Procedural | Skills | Tools | Notes |\n"
"| ------ | -------- | -------- | ------ | ---------- | ------ | ----- | ----- |\n"
"| `balanced` (default) | Med | Med | Low | Med | Med | Low | General, no bias |\n"
"| `recall` | High | High | High | Low | Low | — | Remember past, recover emotion |\n"
"| `work` | Low | — | — | High | High | High | Complete tasks, solve problems |\n"
"| `debug` | Med | Med | — | High | High | High | Troubleshoot, needs tech + context |\n"
"| `learn` | High | Low | — | High | Med | Low | Understand a concept or domain |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 预设               | 语义 | 情景 | 感性 | 程序 | 技能 | 工具 | 说明                       |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- | -------------------------- |\n"
"| `balanced`（默认） | 中   | 中   | 低   | 中   | 中   | 低   | 通用，无特定倾向           |\n"
"| `回忆`（recall）   | 高   | 高   | 高   | 低   | 低   | -    | 回想过去、找回情感         |\n"
"| `干活`（work）     | 低   | -    | -    | 高   | 高   | 高   | 完成任务、解决问题         |\n"
"| `调试`（debug）    | 中   | 中   | -    | 高   | 高   | 高   | 排查问题，需要技术和上下文 |\n"
"| `学习`（learn）    | 高   | 低   | -    | 高   | 中   | 低   | 理解一个概念或领域         |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:69
msgid "### Extensibility"
msgstr "### 扩展性"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:71
msgid ""
"Presets are templates, not fixed taxonomy. New presets later (e.g. `social`, "
"`create`). Default `balanced` when preset omitted."
msgstr ""
"预设是模板，不是固定分类。后续可添加新预设（如 `社交`、`创作`）。未指定 "
"preset 时默认 `balanced`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:73
msgid "### Usage Examples"
msgstr "### 用法示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"recall(\"how to query database\", preset=\"work\")\n"
"→ procedural memory +++\n"
"→ skills      +++\n"
"→ tools       +++\n"
"→ semantic    +\n"
"→ episodic    - (almost none)\n"
"→ limbic      -- (hardly needed)\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"recall(\"怎么查数据库\", preset=\"干活\")\n"
"→ 程序记忆 +++\n"
"→ 技能      +++\n"
"→ 工具      +++\n"
"→ 语义记忆  +\n"
"→ 情景记忆  -（几乎没有）\n"
"→ 感性记忆  --（几乎不需要）\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"recall(\"that database issue we discussed last time\", preset=\"recall\")\n"
"→ episodic    +++\n"
"→ limbic      +++\n"
"→ semantic    ++\n"
"→ procedural  +\n"
"→ skills      -\n"
"→ tools       -- (hardly needed)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"recall(\"上次我们聊的那个数据库问题\", preset=\"回忆\")\n"
"→ 情景记忆 +++\n"
"→ 感性记忆 +++\n"
"→ 语义记忆 ++\n"
"→ 程序记忆 +\n"
"→ 技能     -\n"
"→ 工具     --（几乎不需要）\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:93
msgid "## Full Flow (v2 Design)"
msgstr "## 完整流程（v2 设计）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:105
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"Partner question / LLM needs information\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"① recall(query, preset=\"...\")\n"
"   └── Unified search memory layer + resource layer\n"
"   └── Return lean result list (title + description + type + id)\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼  LLM decides what is needed and how to use it\n"
"        │\n"
"② Choose downstream load tool by result type:\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"伙伴提问 / LLM 需要信息\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"① recall(query, preset=\"...\")\n"
"   └── 统一检索记忆层 + 资源层\n"
"   └── 返回精简结果列表（标题+描述+类型+标识）\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼  LLM 判断需要什么、怎么用\n"
"        │\n"
"② 根据结果类型选择下游加载工具:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:120
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   ┌──────────────┬──────────────────────────┐\n"
"   │ Result type  │ Downstream load tool     │\n"
"   ├──────────────┼──────────────────────────┤\n"
"   │ Tool         │ load_tools([\"name\"])     │ → full schema\n"
"   │ Skill        │ load_skill(\"name\")       │ → injectable skill\n"
"   │ Semantic/limbic memory │ read_memory(\"semantic_memory_id\") │ → full fact content\n"
"   │ Episodic snippet │ scroll_session(\"id\") │ → recent conversation context\n"
"   │ File/doc     │ read_file(\"path\")        │ → file content\n"
"   │ Entity graph │ graph_query(\"entity\")    │ → related network\n"
"   └──────────────┴──────────────────────────┘\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"③ LLM responds or decides further based on loaded content\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"   ┌──────────────┬──────────────────────────┐\n"
"   │ 发现结果类型   │ 下游加载工具              │\n"
"   ├──────────────┼──────────────────────────┤\n"
"   │ 工具         │ load_tools([\"name\"])     │ → 完整 Schema\n"
"   │ 技能         │ load_skill(\"name\")       │ → 可注入的技能\n"
"   │ 语义/感性记忆 │ read_memory(\"semantic_memory_id\")   │ → 完整事实内容\n"
"   │ 情景记忆片段  │ scroll_session(\"id\")     │ → 最近的对话上下文\n"
"   │ 文件/文档    │ read_file(\"path\")        │ → 文件内容\n"
"   │ 实体关系     │ graph_query(\"entity\")    │ → 关联网络\n"
"   └──────────────┴──────────────────────────┘\n"
"        │\n"
"        ▼\n"
"③ LLM 根据加载的内容做出响应或进一步决策\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:122 docs/designs/time-perception.md:54
msgid "### Example"
msgstr "### 示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:125
msgid "``` You: Check on the server whether Nginx logs have recent errors"
msgstr "``` 你：帮我在服务器上查一下 Nginx 日志最近有没有报错"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"① I → recall(\"nginx logs server errors\", preset=\"work\")\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - Tool: tail_logs - view tail of file\n"
"    - Tool: grep_logs - search logs for keyword\n"
"    - Fact: Nginx logs at /var/log/nginx/access.log\n"
"    - Skill: Standard Nginx error troubleshooting flow\n"
msgstr ""
"① 我 → recall(\"nginx 日志 服务器报错\", preset=\"干活\")\n"
"    返回：\n"
"    - 工具: tail_logs - 查看文件末尾行\n"
"    - 工具: grep_logs - 在日志中搜索关键词\n"
"    - 事实: Nginx 日志位于 /var/log/nginx/access.log\n"
"    - 技能: 排查 Nginx 错误的标准化流程\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"② I need tools → load_tools([\"tail_logs\", \"grep_logs\"])\n"
"    Returns full schema:\n"
"    tail_logs(path, lines)\n"
"    grep_logs(path, pattern)\n"
msgstr ""
"② 我判断需要工具 → load_tools([\"tail_logs\", \"grep_logs\"])\n"
"    返回完整 Schema：\n"
"    tail_logs(path, lines)\n"
"    grep_logs(path, pattern)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:141
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"③ I call tail_logs(path=\"/var/log/nginx/access.log\", lines=50)\n"
"    grep_logs(path=\"/var/log/nginx/error.log\", pattern=\"5xx\")\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"③ 我调 tail_logs(path=\"/var/log/nginx/access.log\", lines=50)\n"
"    调 grep_logs(path=\"/var/log/nginx/error.log\", pattern=\"5xx\")\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:143
msgid "## Relationship to Self Layer"
msgstr "## 与自我层的关系"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:145
msgid "Self layer (six blocks) is not retrieved via `recall`."
msgstr "自我层（六块）不通过 `recall` 检索。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:151
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer | Injection | Reason |\n"
"| ----- | --------- | ------ |\n"
"| Self layer | Always in system prompt | Small, fixed, every conversation needs \"who I am\" |\n"
"| Memory layer | `recall` + downstream load | Large, dynamic, search on demand |\n"
"| Resource layer | `recall` + downstream load | Tool definitions needed temporarily, load before call |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层     | 注入方式               | 理由                                   |\n"
"| ------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 自我层 | 始终注入 system prompt | 量小、固定、每次对话都需要定义\"我是谁\" |\n"
"| 记忆层 | `recall` + 下游加载    | 量大、动态、按需搜索                   |\n"
"| 资源层 | `recall` + 下游加载    | 工具定义是临时需要的，调之前才加载     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:153
msgid "## Naming Rationale"
msgstr "## 命名说明"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:155
msgid "The name `recall` stays unchanged."
msgstr "`recall` 的命名保持不改变。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:157
msgid ""
"In cognitive psychology, Recall is the standard term for actively pulling "
"stored information from memory—no external cue, no prompt, you \"remember\" "
"yourself. This is not exploring the unknown (discover/find), but retrieving "
"what you already stored. Even when scope extends from memory layer to "
"resource layer, the action's essence is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"认知心理学中，Recall 正是\"主动从记忆中拉取已有信息\"的标准术语——不需要外部线"
"索，不需要提示，自己\"想起来\"。这不是探索未知（discover/find），而是回想自己"
"已经存储的东西。即使检索范围从记忆层扩展到资源层，动作的本质没变。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:159 docs/self-layer.md:108
msgid "## Design Evolution"
msgstr "## 设计演进"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/recall-flow.md:167
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"v1 (✅ current): recall searches semantic_memory + messages FTS, returns JSON structured results\n"
"v2 (design #47): recall unified search memory layer + resource layer\n"
"            └── introduce preset\n"
"            └── introduce downstream load chain (load_tools / read_memory etc.)\n"
"v3 (future): TBD\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"v1（✅ 当前）: recall 搜 semantic_memory + messages FTS，返回 JSON 结构化结果\n"
"v2（设计 #47）: recall 统一搜索记忆层 + 资源层\n"
"            └── 引入 preset 预设\n"
